--- (3) THE BREAK (G163): z* = 2.37-2.49, registered 'z* = 2.4' ---
  the law holds at z < z* and DEPARTS above z* as a THRESHOLD,
  distinguishable from the rising-a0 ramp (+0.33 growing as log10 E(z))
  G080 sample (z = 0.58-1.68) lies ENTIRELY BELOW z*: the z < z* side is
  validated (flat, slope -0.032 +- 0.077 dex/z), the break itself is
  UNTESTED.  The JWST z~2.5 sample STRADDLES z*: 2.2-2.4 (below) read the
  equilibrium zero point; 2.5-2.8 (above) read the frozen departure.
  registered band [2.3656, 2.4932] (mid 2.429); z* = 2.4 is inside

